7. Member Number Generation

Member registration should follow this process:

Member submits registration
          │
          ▼
Validate input
          │
          ▼
Check duplicate ID number
          │
          ▼
Check duplicate phone number
          │
          ▼
Create member
          │
          ▼
Generate member number
          │
          ▼
NUCSA001

The member number must be generated server-side.

The frontend must never be trusted to generate:

NUCSA001

